        <mxCell id="I05" value="I05  业务类型是 AI漫剧？&#10;以表单中当前业务类型决定条件字段" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#fff7d6;strokeColor=#baa457;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;shape=rhombus;rounded=0;align=center;spacing=5;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="540" y="680" width="390" height="140" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I06" value="I06  漫剧归属字段&#10;作品名称组合框：匹配已有／输入新名；总集数与当前集号可留空" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#fff3e8;strokeColor=#ce9b66;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="55" y="680" width="390" height="140" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I07" value="I07  其他业务&#10;不显示漫剧归属字段；按来源关联或新建作品" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#eaf5ef;strokeColor=#81ab94;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1025" y="680" width="390" height="140" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I08" value="I08  提交校验&#10;必填完整；作品关联有效；集号正整数且不超已知总集数" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#fff7d6;strokeColor=#baa457;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;shape=rhombus;rounded=0;align=center;spacing=5;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="540" y="905" width="390" height="140" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I09" value="I09  校验未通过&#10;抽屉内显示错误；保留输入继续编辑" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#eaf5ef;strokeColor=#81ab94;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="55" y="905" width="390" height="140" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I10" value="I10  保存本地待分析记录&#10;已有待分析同来源／同日记录更新并留初评历史；其他情况新建关联" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#eaf5ef;strokeColor=#81ab94;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="540" y="1130" width="390" height="140" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I11" value="I11  留在情报流&#10;关闭抽屉并提示已提交；冻结本次来源／互动／反馈和人工初评" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#eaf5ef;strokeColor=#81ab94;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1025" y="1130" width="390" height="140" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I12" value="I12  在内容研判查阅 ↗&#10;自行切换研判室；作品／单集及报告可查人工初评" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#edf3ff;strokeColor=#7598c7;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="data:page/id,P3">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1025" y="1355" width="390" height="140" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I13" value="I13  等待真实分析服务&#10;提交不会自动解析、评价或生成新报告" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f4f4f5;strokeColor=#9b9da3;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
