        <mxCell id="W05" value="W05  分集分析 Tab&#10;每集一行：序号＋标题；有／缺资料区分；不设搜索或状态下拉" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f1edff;strokeColor=#9982bd;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
