        <mxCell id="K01" value="K01  知识浏览 #1/0&#10;当前业务正式知识；全部／题材库／金句库／爽点库／翻车点／DNA经典案例＋搜索" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#edf3ff;strokeColor=#7598c7;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="55" y="230" width="390" height="140" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="K02" value="K02  人工新增&#10;左侧按钮；分类、标题、正文、业务、环节及证据" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#fff3e8;strokeColor=#ce9b66;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="540" y="230" width="390" height="140" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="K03" value="K03  来自研判的候选 ↗&#10;作品／单集送审保留来源、证据和版本；不自动入库" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#eaf5ef;strokeColor=#81ab94;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="data:page/id,P3">
